<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - United Wisconsin started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - United Wisconsin started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex Brown said on Tuesday it started coverage on the shares of United Wisconsin Services Inc with a market perform rating.</p>
<p>-- The stock lost 5/8 to 32-7/8.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
